@startuml mec
title mec: Missouri Ethics Commission exports (OPT-IN)
start
if (MOGOV_MEC_OPT_IN=1?) then (no)
  :skip; TAP mirror covers <= 2022;
  stop
endif
partition "ASP.NET WebForms session" {
  :GET form page (keeps __VIEWSTATE);
  :postback per dropdown change (report type, year, election date);
  :submit export button;
  note right
    The export answers with a file, not a page:
    the form keeps the last real page to post back
    from. Posting from the export body lost the
    view state and silently returned the site chrome.
  end note
}
:CF_ContrCSV: one CSV per (report type, year),
one form session per report type;
:CF12_SearchElection: per election date
search + "Excel" export (an HTML table);
:LobExpSearch: lobbyist expenditures 2019+;
note right
  Imperva bot protection; robots.txt disallows.
  3 s pause per request (MOGOV_MEC_PAUSE);
  MEC answers in < 1 s, so the pauses dominate.
  Everything cached: current year weekly, past monthly.
end note
:mec_cd1_a, mec_cd3_b, mec_cd3_c, mec_summary,
mec_candidate_committees, mec_lobbyist_expenditures;
stop
@enduml
